Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,格斯高曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus Gorman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有了 格斯高曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, yes. August Gorman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.95,0:00:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你希望这星期说上班吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you looked for work this week?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的   - 想做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes.  - What kind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 厨房技师  - 洗盘子 找到了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kitchen technician.  - Dishwasher. Any luck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.17,0:00:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不 但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,高曼先生 根据资料显示 你已经36个星期没工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gorman, according to our records, you've been unemployed for 36 weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 只有35个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's 35.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.59,0:00:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这星期不算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not counting this week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你上一份工作 是在保全公司送信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You secured employment in June as a messenger and were discharged after...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.44,0:01:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只做一天就…  - 不是 他们说我把信搞丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...one day for losing...  - No, they said I lost it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.27,0:01:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但我根本没有弄丢 是被别人偷走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not lose it! It was stolen by a pickpocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一部电视机？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A television set?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是一部日本超小型 迷你电视机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a teeny-tiny, teeny-weensy Japanese television set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你又在一家速食店工作 只做了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other employment you found was in a fast-food joint, which lasted...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.15,0:01:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,28分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}28 minutes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.99,0:01:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你的记录居然都是这样 真是快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's some kind of record. Talk about fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那些人都是疯子 要你在一天内学会所有的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those people are crazy. They expect you to learn that stuff in one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要拿生菜 拿蕃茄酱 然后又要酱汁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Hold the lettuce. Hold the ketchup. Can I have some sauce, please?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 高曼先生…  - 要面包 不要面包 又要起司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Gorman...  - "Two buns. No buns. Some cheese."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,高曼先生 大都会市对无业游民 是非常仁慈 但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gorman, the city of Metropolis is generous to a fault, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.01,0:01:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是无业游民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not the fault!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,在失业了36个星期之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-six weeks of chronic unemployment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没有尽到缴税的义务 36个星期了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-six weeks of living off the taxes of hard-working citizens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道你自己目前的处境吗？  - 别说我是无业游民 我不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you know what you are?  - Don't call me a bum, I'm not a bum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你是 而我要说的是 你无法再申请了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are, I was about to say, no longer eligible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.44,0:01:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听着…  - 下一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, look...  - Next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.03,0:01:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那这个星期该怎么办？ 我这星期还要生活啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. What about this week? I need this week!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,下一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:01:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean, that's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.86,0:02:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,确定不能了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Finished", like "over"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,下一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,下一位就表示再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Next" as in "bye."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,下一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 兄弟 可以借个火吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, brother, can I have a light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 艾里  - 嗨 吉米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing, Alex?  - Hi, Jimmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.70,0:04:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,要说谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way to go, Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你的饮料马上说来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your drink is on its way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 有关于这个程式 二个位元同时混合一起运作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but what if you wanna program two bilateral coordinates at the same time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.22,0:08:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你不可以这样作 这不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't do that. It's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.39,0:08:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但如果你不能的话…  - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But if you can't...  - Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.35,0:08:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑技术对年轻小姐是很先进 但你不可这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer technology is very advanced, young lady, but it can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你觉得我们不能这样作 那么你觉得是不是可以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you think we can't do it that way, what happens...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.73,0:08:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.57,0:08:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,天呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么办到的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.12,0:08:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我说是办到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I just did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是谁？  - 就是他 罗斯维斯伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's this?  - That's him, Ross Webster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他刚得到年度人道奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just after he received the award for Humanitarian of the Year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.61,0:08:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他很英俊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is good-looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我用特殊镜头拍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I gave him f.2 at a 50th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有一件事我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thing I don't understand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,专题的重点采访的是 罗斯维斯伯如何获得这个荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the point of the story Lois wrote is how Ross got this great honor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,而你只拍一张他的照片 却拍了十五张她的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you bring me one picture of him and 15 pictures of this other person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她是谁？  - 罗蕾莱 她是维斯伯的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who is she? - Lorelei Ambrosia. She's Webster's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.79,0:09:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是跟着维斯伯 我们不要谈个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's just Webster's. Let's leave it at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.67,0:09:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个女人是谁？  - 他的妹妹 佛庄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's this other woman?  - His sister, Vera Webster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 照片不清楚  - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Picture looks fuzzy.  - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 这看起来很清楚 就好像活生生地站在面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The picture's fine, chief. She looks like that in real life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她是维斯寇集团的副总裁  - 我真的无法明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's VP of Webscoe industries.  - I really don't understand you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.39,0:09:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你去参加个无聊宴会 带回来三千张无聊的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A boring banquet and you bring me 3000 boring pictures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.89,0:09:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,超人今早在第三街 解救快溺死在车里的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet Superman saves a man from drowning on Third Avenue...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.81,0:09:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,而你却傻呼呼地站在旁边 竟连一张照片也没拍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while you just stand there and you don't bring me one picture!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,老板 我当时没有带照相机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief, I didn't have my camera with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,摄影记者吃饭也带着照相机 摄影记者睡觉也带着照相机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A photographer eats with his camera. A photographer sleeps with his camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我很庆幸我只是个文字记者  - 怀特先生 请吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm glad I'm a writer.  - Mr. White, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,需要你抽出本月的幸运号码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time for you to draw this month's winning JINGO number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,奖品是免费到南美的旅游机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prize is an all-expenses trip to South America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真是蠢啊  - 早安各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know why the idiot in Circulation... - Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 克拉克  - 嗨 露易丝 早安吉米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Clark.  - Hi, Lois. Morning, Jimmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你领口有一点芥末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got mustard on your lapel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怀特先生 我不想打扰你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Mr. White, I hate to interrupt...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我现在很忙 我有篇文章要赶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. I'm busy. I got a paper to get out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:10:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦交到印刷厂 就不能再更换的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll never replace the printing press.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.85,0:10:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怀特先生 号码是几号？  - 五十三号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the number, Mr. White?  - Fifty-three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怀特先生…  - 五十三号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. White... - Fifty-three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.64,0:10:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怀特先生…  - 你还要多转出三个号码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. White... - You've got to pull three more numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我答应要回他们电话 你的意思如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised I'd call them back today. What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 肯特 我个人是…  - 我想一定可以写出精彩的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, I don't know, Kent...  - I think it'd make a terrific story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样精彩的故事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a terrific story?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他被邀请回去参加高中同学会  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kent's been invited to his high-school reunion. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的  - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Say.  - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.37,0:10:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可以再来把号码转出来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could we have the next number?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.37,0:10:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是美国的习俗嘛 对吧 吉米？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's practically an American institution. Isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.04,0:10:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我高中的同学 还在念高中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, Mr. Kent. Most of the people I know are still in high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,33号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.80,0:10:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我想这个故事 可以写有关…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I thought this story would be about, Mr. White, is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.76,0:10:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,33号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在过去15年问 典型的小镇究竟有多大转变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is how much the typical small town has changed in the last 15 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,拿我作个例子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me, for example:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我在接受过大都会的洗礼后 还可以回到美中地区生活吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I really go back to middle America now as a Metropolis sophisticate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我想到这里就觉得很兴奋 甚至我昨晚…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really excited about this. In fact, I was looking around...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.03,0:10:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,在我的衣柜里…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in my closet last night...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,找到我高中时代的运动衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I even found my old high-school sweater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.83,0:11:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小镇  - 怀特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Smallville.  - Mr. White.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以计划到那里去旅游吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I go ahead and make my travel plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有同样的问题要问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same question about mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你那些同学 大记者要衣锦荣归了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell your people the prodigal son and his photographer are coming home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.09,0:11:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 怀特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, gee, thanks, Mr. White.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.84,0:11:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我要告诉你 对我来说 最好的记者不在身边实在不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't easy for me to lose one of my best reporters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.40,0:11:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没问题的  - 你应该放假 露易丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's okay.  - You deserve the vacation, Lois.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.89,0:11:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,露易丝 你要去什么地方玩吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois, are you going someplace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克 有人千方百计要去小镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark, you know some people get to go all the way to Smallville...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.47,0:11:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但也有些人 向往着要去百慕达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then there are others of us who have to go to Bermuda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.77,0:11:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Golly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.31,0:11:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye.  - Bye, Miss Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.15,0:11:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 玩得尽兴  - 怀特先生 你还要抽一个号码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have fun.  - Mr. White, the next number, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我也该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess I better be going too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那我要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'll be going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不能用电脑来做吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't we get a computer to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？  - 你的第一份薪水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, what is this?  - First paycheck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.49,0:12:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但我一个星期 应该有225元吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the first rip-off, man! We're supposed to get 225 a week, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.87,0:12:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只拿到143点8元 这样如何过活？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This says, "$143.80." How am I supposed to live on that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.37,0:12:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,州税 联邦税 社会安全税…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}State tax, federal tax, social security tax...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,等到65岁 你就可以拿到被扣掉的钱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so you're still getting some money when you hit 65.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.67,0:12:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,要等到65岁才拿得到钱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm getting money when I... 65?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.13,0:12:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但我现在就需要钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want mine now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.59,0:12:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我要趁年轻享受 没有钱我怎能享受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to enjoy it while I'm young. I wanna get up and get down. Boogie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:13:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上应该有 143点8元再加上半毛钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, it's probably more like $143.80 and one half cent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,总是会有剩余的钱 但是都是公司拿走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are always fractions left over, but big corporations round it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.15,0:13:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,半毛钱有什么用？ 塞牙缝都不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I do with half a cent? Buy a thoroughbred mouse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.11,0:13:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人剩余的钱都被拿走了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody loses those fractions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.15,0:13:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不能说被拿走了 因为你根本没有拿到手上过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't lose them. You can't lose what you never got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.15,0:13:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢？ 是公司拿走的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what happens? The company gets them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.53,0:13:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是 他们根本不会像你一样 如此在意此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can't be bothered collecting that from your paycheck any more than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那钱会如何处理？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what happens to them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只有电脑知道资金的运作情况 知道钱在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they're just floating around out there. The computers know where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.71,0:13:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,糖要多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many sugars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.92,0:13:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一个半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One and a half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,下班了 格斯 你还不走？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's quitting time, Gus. You coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.56,0:13:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 但我还有些事情 没做完 所以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. No, actually, I got some stuff to finish up, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,加班工作？想干什么？ 想要加薪吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Working overtime, huh? What are you doing, buddy? Looking for a raise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.07,0:13:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对 想要加薪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, looking for a raise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.94,0:14:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.11,0:14:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我姑父站在支持我父亲的一边 他不吃她烹调的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my Uncle Al on my father's side, he won't eat her stuffing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他说火鸡该从外面烤 她却要从里面烤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says it should be cooked on the outside. She cooks it on the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈说 我姑母海伦是我爸的干妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother told my Aunt Helen. She's my father's half sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.17,0:14:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我告诉过你 对吗？  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I told you that, right?  - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 总之…  - 嘿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And anyway, the family...  - Hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.63,0:14:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看 - 哗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look at that.  - Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以选择开回去 或是靠边停 等到结束为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can turn back or pull over till it's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.86,0:15:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要等多久呢？  - 无法判断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long will it take?  - Can't tell with these fires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.61,0:15:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这种火烧起来 会有蔓延的可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, that fire... That's spreading like wildfire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不过只是一栋建筑物着火罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a building burning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.53,0:15:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,一栋建筑物？ 这是化学工厂呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not just a building. That's a chemical plant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.37,0:15:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂我的意思了吧  化学工厂起火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I mean. It's like... it's like chemicals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.87,0:15:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,随时可能会有浓烟 将这附近给遮盖住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If any of that stuff goes up in smoke, we're in for a hairy time around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,放轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克拉克  - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clark.  - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.67,0:15:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你替我分散他们的注意力 这样他们才不知道我要干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to keep these people distracted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.05,0:15:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.38,0:15:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,干什么？ 你记得老板的话吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I doing? Remember what the chief said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.91,0:15:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,摄影记者永远要配合上报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A photographer always goes after a story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.95,0:15:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但这很危险的 吉米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could be dangerous, Jimmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,危险 它是随时存在的 肯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danger goes with the territory, Mr. Kent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.33,0:16:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me! Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.50,0:16:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能帮得上忙吗？  - 帮他拿顶头盔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How can I help?  - Get this man a helmet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.01,0:16:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喔 是你 你来得正好  - 情况如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's you. Forget the helmet.  - How bad is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,天呀 超人 这真像一场恶梦 所有的东西不是爆炸就是冒烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, it's a nightmare. Everything's either explosive or flammable or worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快把云梯车开过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the ladder truck in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 够不着  - 天呀 他们被困住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It won't reach.  - My God, they're trapped!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.23,0:16:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他要干什么？ 一次载一个下来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he gonna do? Fly them down one at a time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.25,0:17:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 大家从这里走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Everybody, down there! Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.63,0:17:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,从这里 慢慢来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right down there. Take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.51,0:17:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 所有人都下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Everybody down there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.39,0:17:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,继续前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.93,0:18:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 你要离开这里越快越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, get out. I'll show you the quickest way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.31,0:18:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我要照顾这些仪器 不能离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on. Look after the others. I can't leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为何？  - 我要照顾那些物品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why not?  - I gotta stay and look after those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.06,0:18:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是浓缩的硫化酸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's concentrated Beltric acid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.81,0:18:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,如果热度超过180度 就会过热燃烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that stuff heats up over 180 degrees, we've got a crisis...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.11,0:18:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,所引起的危机及火势 就不可收拾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that'll make this fire look like a picnic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.61,0:18:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那要怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果保持温度稳定 就没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as it remains stable, it's just ordinary acid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.11,0:18:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但一旦开始受热 它就很容易会爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if it begins to heat up, it'll turn volatile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就会有很浓的烟雾 会穿透任何的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll get a great cloud of smoke that will eat through anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,钢铁 水泥 任何的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steel, concrete, anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.05,0:18:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你在那里搞什么鬼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.43,0:18:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 离开那里   - 我只是拍几张火灾的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, you! Get off of there! - I'm just gonna get a couple more shots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.77,0:19:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow! Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,叫他们快点来灭火 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them to bring their hoses back here! Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.13,0:19:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 有人能救我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Somebody help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 救命   - 没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help!  - It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.43,0:19:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 超人 我的腿  - 我抓到你了 轻松点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Superman! My leg.  - I got you. Take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们慢慢来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. We'll go nice and easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.18,0:19:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 抱歉 好了吗？走罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm sorry. All right? Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,担架 快过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medics! Over here, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.65,0:19:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,轻轻地 他左腿骨折了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go easy. It's the left leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.99,0:19:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 照相机  - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My camera.  - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,只是单纯的骨折\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a clean break right across the fibula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.45,0:19:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的照相机  - 抱歉 吉米 你会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My camera.  - Sorry, Jimmy. You'll be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:20:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要集中水扑灭实验室的火 不然里面的硫化酸会过热爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that fire out, otherwise there'll be an acid cloud all over the Eastern seaboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天啊 抽水车没作用了   - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The pump house is gone!  - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.72,0:20:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抽水车   - 我们抽不到水了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The pump house! - We've lost the water pressure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.93,0:20:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们要找到水来   - 要怎么找？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We've got to have water!  - How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.89,0:20:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,卡摩嘉湖离这里五英里路 五英里的远水救不了近火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lake Comooga's five miles from here. We'd need a five-mile hose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.06,0:20:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 湖在哪里？  - 那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's this lake?  - That way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他们没希望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them it's hopeless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.03,0:20:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是你说水源充足的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me we had an adequate water supply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,水来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Water!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.82,0:21:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 那人是个奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you, that man's a miracle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.68,0:22:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,卡罗 你真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carol, you got gorgeous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.69,0:22:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.62,0:22:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那次对抗城中队 我永生难忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was against Mid-City. I'll never forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.21,0:22:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,第四节 打成平手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fourth quarter, score was tied...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.67,0:22:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在二十五码线上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're back at the 25-yard line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.17,0:22:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,教练下达指令 右翼突破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coach sends in a play, Right Flanker Option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.31,0:23:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的长大了不少 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really have grown, Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.69,0:23:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你身体也不错 班尼丝太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look very well, Miss Bannister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.73,0:23:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,算是不错了 虽然爬楼梯慢点 记忆还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't complain. I take the stairs a little slow and I have these spells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.32,0:23:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的算不错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But really, I can't complain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.16,0:23:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,拉娜？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lana?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.37,0:23:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我有别的朋友来 要去打个招呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you excuse me? There's someone I'd really like to say hello to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.92,0:23:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,拉娜？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lana?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.55,0:23:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拉娜？真高兴见到你  - 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lana Lang? It's great to see you.  - Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.05,0:23:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看来师极了  - 不 你才是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You look wonderful.  - Me? No, you look...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.64,0:23:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来帮你  - 不用 我自己可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me give you a hand with that.  - No, no. I can manage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.15,0:23:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是自从你妈过世后 你第一次从大都会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the first time you've come back since your mom passed away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.61,0:23:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对的 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.45,0:23:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说是你和…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard that you and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.57,0:24:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 唐诺分手了？  - 你吃了没？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...Donald split up.  - Did you eat yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.12,0:24:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.45,0:24:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,借过 对不起 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beg your pardon. Excuse me. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.96,0:24:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个不对  - 不对？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not right.  - No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.96,0:24:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我和唐诺的事你说得对… 不过 你替我拿一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right about Donald and me, but... Hold this, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.67,0:24:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.47,0:24:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 肯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Kent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.30,0:24:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 你好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.81,0:24:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我竟然弄错了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I'm going nuts. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.98,0:24:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克拉克  - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clark.  - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.82,0:24:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,拉娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.32,0:24:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.82,0:24:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.20,0:24:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,记得你当选为舞会皇后 一票人等着要和你跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember when you were prom queen? All these guys were waiting for a dance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.50,0:24:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只剩下一个人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one guy on your dance card now. Huh, honey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.33,0:24:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真是美好的…  - 布莱德威尔逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's good old...  - Brad Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.79,0:24:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 布莱德  - 嗨 肯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Brad.  - Hi, Kent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.59,0:24:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long time no see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.51,0:24:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂吧 “不见”？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, see, see, see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.09,0:25:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来吧 拉娜  - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Lana.  - No, I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.01,0:25:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克拉克他先请我的 - 我有吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clark already asked me.  - I did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.14,0:25:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有 - 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah.  - Oh, excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.10,0:25:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,拉娜 我好久没跳…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lana, I haven't danced...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.77,0:25:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,高曼 又一星期又一张支票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, Gorman. Another week, another check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.49,0:26:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有另外一张支票要给我？ 我申请了公费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you have another one for me? I put in a voucher for expenses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.57,0:26:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.24,0:26:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.58,0:26:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.44,0:26:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮我收拾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for helping me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.52,0:26:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你别客气 拉娜 很多人羡慕我有机会帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kidding? A lot of guys would like to be where I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.32,0:26:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你会惊讶我根本没有成觉到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd be surprised at how many offers I didn't get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.90,0:26:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至布莱德都不会留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even Brad wouldn't stick around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.82,0:26:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It really isn't easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.45,0:26:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这些长幡？你只要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The streamers? Yeah, you just pull, and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.62,0:26:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这些长幡 是全部的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not the streamers. Everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.33,0:26:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我要抱怨 只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that I'm complaining. It's just that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.87,0:26:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么 我觉得我可以和你谈心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know why, I just feel like I can talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.96,0:26:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.25,0:26:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我可以和你谈心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like I can talk to you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.55,0:27:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can?  - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.34,0:27:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道吗 拉娜？  - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know something, Lana?  - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.34,0:27:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.43,0:27:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直希望你会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always wished that you would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.35,0:27:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至在高中时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, even back in high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.47,0:27:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 记得你是…  - 舞会皇后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Remember when you were...  - Queen of the prom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.73,0:27:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,经过三年的婚姻 他退出了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then three years after the royal wedding, the king abdicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.98,0:27:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是不是太糟了吗？  - 的确是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isn't that terrible?  - Yeah, sure is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.32,0:27:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定剩下一大堆的洋芋沙拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must be a gallon of potato salad left over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.78,0:27:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道问题所在吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what the problem is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.78,0:27:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 是太多美乃滋了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, too much mayonnaise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.87,0:27:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,唐诺喜欢吃美乃滋 这不会有问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donald loved mayonnaise. Why would that be the problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.83,0:27:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是为什么我要留在小镇？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the problem is, why do I stay in Smallville?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.87,0:27:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我一直这样自问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, I've asked myself that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.88,0:27:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你有多幸运能住在大都会？ 人人向往的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know how lucky you are to live in Metropolis? The Big Apricot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.50,0:27:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那你可以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Lana, you could...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.92,0:27:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,说来容易 我不能不顾瑞奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy to say. But how? What about Ricky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.93,0:27:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瑞奇？  - 我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ricky?  - My little boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.68,0:27:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的 这不错  - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You? Oh, that's great.  - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.01,0:27:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里 我们有一栋房子 我有工作可以支付帐单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, at least here we have a house and I've got a job that pays the bills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.69,0:27:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但是去年冬天开始 燃料就变得越来越贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for last winter when the fuel bills kept going up and up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.90,0:28:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至把结婚钻戒拿去当了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Even had to pawn my diamond ring then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.03,0:28:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那真可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a shame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.04,0:28:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没有结婚吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never got married?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.79,0:28:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我吗？  - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Me?  - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.92,0:28:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.84,0:28:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.55,0:28:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗？ 几年后再看到某人就会想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, years later you can look at someone and think:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.68,0:28:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我想 那就是我错过的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Well, I guess that's the one that got away."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.32,0:28:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再说一次 我要再听一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that again, old buddy. Run it by me just one more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.07,0:28:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 八万五千元  - 不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Eighty-five thousand dollars.  - Missing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.74,0:28:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,一笔完整的钱 从公司中被侵占\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Embezzled, Mr. Webster. Stolen from the firm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.53,0:28:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谁干的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.95,0:28:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我要知道是谁干的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I want to know. By whom? Whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.66,0:28:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,佛莅 控制一下自己吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vera, get ahold of yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.17,0:29:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,从未有人敢如此做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody else ever will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.25,0:29:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.59,0:29:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.75,0:29:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,在往日事情简单得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the old days it was simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.09,0:29:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有帐簿 有收据 哪一笔帐出去 哪一笔帐进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We kept books, we knew what was going in and what was paid out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.68,0:29:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,即使有人要抢钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If somebody wanted to rob you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.51,0:29:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都带着枪进来说 把钱装进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'd come in with a gun and say, "Stick them up."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.27,0:29:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这些人利用复杂的电脑 做这种下流事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now they get blasted computers to do their dirty work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.98,0:29:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我的老朋友 你成为老古董了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My old friend, you are yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.06,0:29:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,至于谁做了此事 将会是明日之星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever pulled this caper is tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.07,0:29:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,维斯伯先生 该是你按摩的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Webster, it's time for your massage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.40,0:29:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这种女人怎能突然闯进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this woman have the right to burst in...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.49,0:29:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 佛莅 辛普森 这位是我物理治疗师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, now, Vera. Simpson, you know my psychic nutritionist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.29,0:29:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈罗  - 抱歉 我们正要在此闻会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello.  - We are trying to hold a meeting here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.58,0:29:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你为何不省省力别讲话 这样很容易血压上升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you hold your breath instead. Maybe you'll turn blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.79,0:29:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没水准  - 注意 我正要取你的人命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Improvement.  - I'm about to take a human life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.30,0:29:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,辛普森 请你回避几分钟好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simpson, would you excuse us for a second, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.10,0:29:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 用耳听  - 她是一只大肥猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mouths closed. Ears open.  - She's a big pig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.31,0:30:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不容许不服从我的人 和我一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't have anyone with me who isn't with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.77,0:30:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 女孩们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.60,0:30:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,辛普森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simpson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.44,0:30:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,老朋友 现在该如何呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, old chum. What now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.07,0:30:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就让八万五千块飞走吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiss the 85 thou goodbye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.99,0:30:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,持续让他得手 以为这是摇钱树吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep on paying the thief his salary until he shakes the money tree again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.15,0:30:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他迟早会露出马脚的  - 为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's bound to slip up sooner or later.  - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.28,0:30:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道 在电影中常是这样演的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what they always say in the movies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.83,0:30:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会不露马脚的 不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't slip up at all. No, not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.54,0:30:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定会继续从我的口中 不断地偷食我的面包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll keep quietly taking the bread from our mouths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.33,0:30:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定会不断地做 越陷越深露出马脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll keep a low profile and won't do a thing to call attention to himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.80,0:30:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 除非他真是一位天才罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless, of course, he is a complete and utter moron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.82,0:30:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我先选 安德鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go first. Andrew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.78,0:30:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我选克立思  - 你准备好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll pick Chris.  - You feel good? You feel ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.45,0:30:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇 你的球鞋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}LANA Ricky, your shoe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.87,0:31:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们要和瑞奇一组吗？  - 你们猜拳输了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You mean, we've gotta take Ricky?  - You guys lost the toss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.37,0:31:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 瑞奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, come on, Ricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.71,0:31:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等  - 祝好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait, wait... - Come on, good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.83,0:31:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我真受不了这样  - 拉娜 没事的 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I just can't stand this.  - Oh, Lana. It'll be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.88,0:31:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己也是大器晚成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, I was a late bloomer myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.38,0:31:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是因为他年纪小 他是镇上唯一没父亲的小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not just that he's small, he's the only kid in town without a father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.47,0:31:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 才下午就醉醺醺了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look. He's stewed to the gills in the middle of the afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.98,0:31:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我只喝了巧克力牛奶  - 不 我是指他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gee, all he had was chocolate milk.  - No, him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.39,0:31:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, sweet thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.31,0:31:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,小朋友在比赛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little kid getting hassled, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.90,0:31:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肯特 你也在这儿？  - 是啊 布莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kent, you still here?  - I seem to be, Brad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.61,0:31:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他只需要有冠军经验的人 指导一下就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All he needs is a few pointers from the old champ here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.70,0:31:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我参加了两年的 全国保龄球巡回比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won the all-country bowling trophy two years in a row.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.73,0:31:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这我还不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.55,0:31:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,天生有运动细胞的人 什么运动都会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Natural athlete can play any sport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.87,0:31:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱德 你只会搞砸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brad, you're just gonna make it worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.83,0:31:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没关系 没事的  - 克拉克 他会搞砸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's all right. It'll be okay.  - He'll make it worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.67,0:31:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你看着 他会补进的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You watch, he'll get a spare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.92,0:31:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 瑞奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Ricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.76,0:31:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子 你球拿错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, kid, you're holding it all wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.22,0:32:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我示范一次给你看  - 布莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let old Brad show you how it's done.  - Brad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.43,0:32:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 布莱德 我想最好还是让孩子他自己打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Say, Brad, I think maybe he'll be better off doing it his way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.69,0:32:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你这种不入流的人 话还真多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a guy lucky to be waterboy, you've got a big mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.65,0:32:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想说瑞奇不会希望 在同伴面前 被指导如何打球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think he needs a lesson in front of the other kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.90,0:32:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他需要有人教他  - 他会没事的 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He needs a man to show him.  - He's doing just fine. Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.66,0:32:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧 瑞奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, Ricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.16,0:32:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,尽全力 好吗？去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And give it your best shot. Okay? There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.58,0:32:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.89,0:32:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,保重啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gesundheit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.48,0:32:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.69,0:32:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,格斯 老板要见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Gus, the boss wants to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.15,0:32:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直在看着我 你好吗？老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can see me all right. Hello, Mr. Lewis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.90,0:32:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那位老板 是大老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not that boss. The boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.49,0:33:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是说大老板 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You mean, the boss...  - Yup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.20,0:33:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要见我？ - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...wants to see me?  - Yup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.83,0:33:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他要见我干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, why would he wanna see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.21,0:33:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.67,0:33:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,老板要见我干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would the boss wanna see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.25,0:33:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没有原因吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.21,0:33:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那为何他… 我知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why'd he... Oh, I know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.92,0:33:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是关于 我对排球制服的意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my suggestion for the volleyball uniforms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.22,0:33:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.02,0:33:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,罗斯老板…老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ross the boss. Ross the boss. The boss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.15,0:33:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静 镇静 要坦然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be calm. Be cool. Be collected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.95,0:33:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,维斯伯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Webster? Mr. Webster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.50,0:33:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,维斯伯先生 我…维斯伯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Webster, I did not... Mr. Webster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.21,0:33:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,格斯高曼先生吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. August Gorman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.38,0:33:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 我就是高曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}August Gorman here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.84,0:34:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你心肠很好 我不要坐牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're a man of compassion, and I don't wanna go to jail...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.55,0:34:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们那里有 强盗犯 强奸犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because they have robbers and rapists...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.76,0:34:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是要问你一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna ask you one question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.35,0:34:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你是一个很顽皮的人 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been a naughty guy, haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.31,0:34:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,说良心话吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, admit it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.89,0:34:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你在工作上常有一点顽皮 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been just a little bit naughty, haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.65,0:34:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是那一种…  - 好了 不用多说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was kind of...  - That's all right. I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.57,0:34:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以了解年轻人 现在的心态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can... What do the young folks say today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.99,0:34:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,梦想出人头地的心情 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dig where you're coming from, brother."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.86,0:34:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想要发财 是吗？ - 该怎样…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wanna be rich, right?  - How, wha...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.91,0:34:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我一出生便注定富有 从不重复穿同一双袜子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was born rich. Never worn the same pair of socks twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.58,0:34:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那你怎样处理那些袜子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you do with your socks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.33,0:34:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去洗了 再送给慈善机构了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. They're laundered and sent to some charitable institution, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.42,0:34:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道或许变成别的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I don't know. Maybe they turn them into dust rags...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.80,0:34:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是立可白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or pen-wipers or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.42,0:34:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是袜子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe socks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.30,0:34:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我从不管这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! That never occurred to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.26,0:34:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,格斯 你知道你的确是一位天才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus, you know something? You're a genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.31,0:34:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一位顽皮的天才 但又如何 没有人是十全十美的 干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A naughty genius, but what the hell? Nobody's perfect, right? Cheers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.10,0:34:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为我用电脑 把半毛钱转出来的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of the half-cent thing with the computers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.36,0:34:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不…是因为电脑控制了 今日整个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, because computers rule the world today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.44,0:35:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,而控制电脑的人可以控制世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fellow that can fool the computers can rule the world himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.11,0:35:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都在物色一位 能成功地利用电脑的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been searching for somebody who can make these machines...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.78,0:35:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,做人所不能的事 你明白我的意思吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do what they're not supposed to. Get my drift?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.54,0:35:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明白   - 格斯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes!  - Gus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.41,0:35:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,维斯寇集团 维斯寇工业 是一个家族的大企业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Webscoe, the Webscoe industrial complex, is a family-owned cartel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.42,0:35:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有些是要探测镁矿 有些要找锌矿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some magnesium here, some zinc there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.46,0:35:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,铁路 农业机械 你在听吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Railroads, farm machinery. You follow me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.63,0:35:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我在听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I follow you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.34,0:35:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 格斯 你知道我想要什么吗？  - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gus, do you know what I want now?  - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.64,0:35:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我要咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.89,0:35:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,需要奶 糖 还是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Black, cream, sugar, or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.85,0:35:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 你似乎不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you don't seem to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.10,0:35:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,众多不同的公司品牌 我要控制咖啡的价格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under different company names, I control the price of coffee beans...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.73,0:35:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,在委内瑞拉 巴西 玻利维亚 牙买加 加彭共和国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Venezuela, Brazil, Bolivia, Jamaica and the Republic of Gabon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.07,0:35:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我现在有一个问题 你大概可以帮我解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've got a problem and I think maybe you can help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.99,0:35:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就是有一个国家不赏我的脸 我想你知道这有多丢脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One country won't play ball with me. You know how that can bug a guy, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.16,0:35:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不赏脸… 那个国家？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could bug... What country?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.87,0:35:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哥伦比亚  - 哥伦比亚？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Colombia.  - Colombia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.29,0:35:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哥国是极重要的 咖啡进出口国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colombia has two important exports, and one of them's coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.50,0:36:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我试过多次 相信我 我真的试过多次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've tried to reason with them. Believe me, I've tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.34,0:36:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但这真是令人难过的 固执国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this one miserable, pissant little country...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.67,0:36:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,以为可以阻碍了我的目标 不让我独占这个市场 格斯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has the gall to think it can dictate the economy of an open market. Gus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.51,0:36:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,格斯 我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus, my friend...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.68,0:36:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要给他们一个教训 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're going to teach them a lesson, aren't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.52,0:36:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,毁掉哥伦比亚所有的咖啡田\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy the entire Colombian coffee crop...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.52,0:36:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,令他们成为不毛之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right down to the last bean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.19,0:36:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不毛之地？我们？  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The last bean, we are.  - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.69,0:36:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但你拥有这么多了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you got so much. You know, like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.20,0:36:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道为什么有人曾说 我想说的人真是独具慧眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A wise man once said, I think it was Attila the Hun:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.12,0:36:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,“成功还不足够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"It is not enough that I succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.91,0:36:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,必须其他人都失败”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone else must fail."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.12,0:36:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.92,0:36:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 格斯  - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gus.  - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.54,0:36:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你要为我做这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are going to do this for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.84,0:36:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么做？  - 利用天气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How?  - The weather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.72,0:36:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有告诉我你妈妈会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't say your mother was here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.55,0:36:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我是他的妹妹 他最小的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm his sister. His baby sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.72,0:36:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,格斯 告诉我 难道你从未听过华根吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus, tell me, have you ever heard of Vulcan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.06,0:36:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 华根小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Ms. Vulcan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.56,0:37:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,华根是气象卫星 是政府设在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vulcan is the weather satellite our government put up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.57,0:37:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,运行轨道中 监视气象变化用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to monitor the weather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.07,0:37:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果有人能重新输入程式 它便能发挥更大的功效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if somebody were to reprogram it, it could do much more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.57,0:37:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可以制造天气的变化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could make weather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.36,0:37:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,风暴或洪水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Storms and floods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.07,0:37:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,暴风雪 热浪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blizzards, heat waves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.08,0:37:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.66,0:37:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就像二十世纪 每一件事的作法一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like everything else in the 20th century, Gus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.08,0:37:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要按几个键就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You push buttons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.25,0:37:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了  - 这是我一生中第一次赢得东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There you go.  - It's the first time I won anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.67,0:37:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你赢得我的芳心 莫瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won my hand, Maury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.09,0:37:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但这是我第一次 赢得有价值的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this is the first time I won anything valuable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.09,0:37:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,戴上草帽会更像样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get one with the sombreros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.97,0:37:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,怀特先生 你过来把机票交给他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. White, you'll be in this, handing them their plane tickets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.47,0:37:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么总要我做这种事？  - 为什么总要我做这种事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why do I have to do this?  - Why do I have to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.10,0:37:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你 你没被开除算运气好 本来有独家的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky I didn't fire you. I get a chance at exclusive photos...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.60,0:37:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,史上最大化学工厂火灾的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of history's biggest factory fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.61,0:37:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,回来时腿断了 照片也熔化了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He comes home with a broken leg and 12 melted rolls of film.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.61,0:37:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因为热度太高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.11,0:37:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,笑一笑 怀特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smile, Mr. White.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.28,0:37:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,南美洲 我不敢相信我的运气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}South America! I can't believe my luck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.37,0:37:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,注意 你想要做但不被人发现…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, if you don't want them to trace it back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.50,0:38:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,得找个隐密不引人注意的基地 装置一台电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've gotta punch in to some little rinky-dink outfit...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.79,0:38:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一台小但功能多的电脑就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that has a little Mickey Mouse computer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.46,0:38:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以藏身的地方 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someplace you can sneak into, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.63,0:38:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有人可以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody could...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.01,0:38:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那个地方没有人认识他 他们此不会怀疑他和我们有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someplace where nobody knows him so they can't connect him with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.22,0:38:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,维斯寇集团有112家子公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Webscoe has 112 subsidiaries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.39,0:38:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,所有电脑系统都和中央电脑连线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all linked into the central computer system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.56,0:38:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,要找一个…这种地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about someplace...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.10,0:38:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,小地方？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}small?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.81,0:38:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,小镇 小镇到了 我们停留五分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smallville. This is Smallville. We'll have a five-minute stop here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.78,0:38:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,小心走路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind your step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.07,0:38:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,小心楼梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your step, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.57,0:38:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 席玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Selma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.78,0:38:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 拉娜 愿你玩得愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks a lot, Lana. Have a good day, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.45,0:38:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,让我帮你 拉娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me help you, Lana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.83,0:38:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.25,0:38:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 克拉克  - 你去坐下 巴士达 乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks, Clark.  - Sit down, Buster. Good boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.84,0:38:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下 巴士达 别乱动 乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Buster, sit down. That's a good boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.55,0:38:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都好了吗？很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. You all set? Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.18,0:39:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.52,0:39:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不再多说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not saying another word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.69,0:39:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.28,0:39:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,天呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.20,0:39:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在大都会也有郊游吗？ 肯特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't they have picnics in Metropolis, Mr. Kent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.46,0:39:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有 只是和这里的不大一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, not quite like this, Ricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.59,0:39:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈和我常一块出来郊游  - 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom and I do this all the time.  - You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.71,0:39:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我帮你  - 瑞奇 别走远 要小心 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll help you.  - Stay close by and be careful, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.88,0:39:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.38,0:39:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,来 巴士达 去找兔子 来 巴士达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Buster. Let's find you a rabbit. Come on. Buster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.01,0:39:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这样对他来说太好了 - 做得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is so nice for him.  - Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.14,0:39:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,难得有一位男性在他身边 这对他的成长较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's even nicer when there's a man around, which isn't that often.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.68,0:39:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有好多的选择机会  - 不 所有好的男人都结婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's a lot of choices.  - The good ones are married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.40,0:39:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所以布莱德以为 他是上帝给女人的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why Brad thinks he's God's gift to women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.40,0:39:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他不接受拒绝 但只有他自己在要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't take no for an answer, but he's the only one asking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.61,0:39:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不 拉娜 我还是觉得有很多选择的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Lana, I meant there's a lot of choices here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.49,0:39:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是不错的郊游 有这种…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is really quite some picnic. There's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.82,0:40:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.54,0:40:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,绿东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.33,0:40:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,豆泥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, pate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.25,0:40:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这种豆泥味道真特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, this pate is really unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.25,0:40:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有弄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't make any... Oh, Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.76,0:40:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是巴士达的狗食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Buster's dog food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.93,0:40:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 蛮好吃的啊  - 别再吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's good.  - Don't eat it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.64,0:40:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,小狗什么时候吃？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time's the dog eat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.14,0:40:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真不错  - 拿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is nice.  - Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.26,0:40:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的 拉娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right, Lana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.39,0:40:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.40,0:40:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你去那里？回来 巴士达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where you going? Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.44,0:40:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,巴士达 不要闹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buster, stop messing about!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.65,0:40:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要待多久？  - 我正在想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How much longer...  - I was just thinking...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.78,0:40:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 请说  - 你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry. No, go ahead.  - No. You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.45,0:40:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.79,0:40:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想 像你这样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just thinking that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.79,0:40:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一定可以在大都会发展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somebody like you could do really well in Metropolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.29,0:40:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我非得如此了 小镇里没有我要的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose I have to face it. I'm not gonna find what I want in Smallville anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.35,0:40:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.26,0:41:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以在大都会过活吗？ 我能做什么工作？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could I make it in Metropolis? What would I do when I got there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.43,0:41:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,打电话给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.64,0:41:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 我不想打给你  - 你不想打给我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I wouldn't wanna call you.  - You don't wanna call me?{\r}
