Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.06,0:53:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬间强风…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gale-force winds up to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.93,0:53:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,高达时速250英里 冲击到所有村庄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an incredible 250 miles an hour lashed the countryside...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.56,0:53:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,同时在当天雨量达12英寸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while 12 inches of rainfall have already been recorded in just one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.65,0:53:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我引述 气象局发官人的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A spokesman for the Department of Meteorology said this was, I quote:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.07,0:53:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最可怕的自然力量…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The most awesome display of natural forces since Noah's ark."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.03,0:53:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我再笑下去我会歪一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I laugh any harder, I'll split my sides!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.04,0:54:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,气象似乎已经违背了 所有的理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To defy all laws of weather systems known to science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.34,0:54:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a shame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.34,0:54:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的哥伦比亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor little Colombia. Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.10,0:54:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你真淘气 你这个大笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get you for that, you big silly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.77,0:54:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,老哥 你真的了解我们在干嘛吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bubba, do you realize what we're on to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.94,0:54:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,了解吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.69,0:54:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,以后所有人喝的咖啡 就是维斯伯咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time a drunk sobers up, he'll drink Webster coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.99,0:54:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为何要选咖啡？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why stop at coffee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.37,0:54:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一杯咖啡就可以让全世界 早上出门去上班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cup of coffee gets the world off to work in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.29,0:54:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但又是什么让世界运作？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what keeps the world working?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.25,0:54:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,低糖汽水？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diet soda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.54,0:54:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,佛莅 你是说？你是说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vera, you mean? You mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.79,0:54:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.42,0:54:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,明天此是石油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow, the oil!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.13,0:54:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 石油？  - 如果高曼可以正确地运用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oil?  - If Gus can push the right buttons...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.80,0:54:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我就可以控制全世界的石油 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can have it all. Holy cats!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.76,0:54:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的石油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the oil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.56,0:54:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的油井\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the pumps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.97,0:55:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的油槽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the tankers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.60,0:55:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是个不错的主意 佛莅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is some nifty idea, Vera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.31,0:55:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老板  - 非常不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Boss?  - Very nifty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.15,0:55:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我正好要找你  - 老板…这不是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just the man I want to see.  - Boss, it is not my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.98,0:55:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,干得是不是很好…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it neat? There...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.82,0:55:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么不是你的错？  - 超人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's not your fault?  - Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.40,0:55:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道 他会阻扰你的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was I to know he was gonna start doing his thing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.16,0:55:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,当你要这样做呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you started doing your thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.49,0:55:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么？  - 我在说什么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you talking about? - What am I talk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.45,0:55:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就是电视上播的 老兄 你没看到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just on television, man. Didn't you see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.54,0:55:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别叫我“老兄”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't call me "man."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.12,0:55:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到哥伦比亚被毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just saw Colombia bite the dust. That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.58,0:55:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你没看到他从云端飞出来吗？ 就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't see the man come flying out of the sky from the clouds? It was him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.34,0:55:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他的斗蓬飞扬 然后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With his cape flapping in the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.14,0:55:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他的斗蓬就是在飞扬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His cape was flapping in the wind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.18,0:55:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他在飞翔 真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was flying! He was great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.64,0:55:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was just flying around...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.69,0:55:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就像这样穿过云层 就这样地飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His cape was blowing in the wind like this. It looked like a flag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.27,0:55:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他就降落在大农场的中间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he landed right in the middle of this big plantation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.57,0:55:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他就先用透视眼检查了状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he checked everything out with his x-ray vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.99,0:56:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他用雷射眼 修后所有的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then he put these laser beams out of his eyes onto everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.33,0:56:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,用雷射修复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight-out laser points.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.58,0:56:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,把所有的东西都弄干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dried up everything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.58,0:56:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就在一瞬间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.21,0:56:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就像在厕所的烘手机一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking about drying it up, like machines in the men's rooms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.51,0:56:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我在说什么吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.72,0:56:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,手放在下面热空气会出来 你可把手烘干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hot air comes out when you put your hands under.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.18,0:56:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有时是没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes they don't work, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.05,0:56:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,而超人办到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Superman's worked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.60,0:56:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为他在开玩笑吗？ 这家伙不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think he stood around to take bows? Not this man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.81,0:56:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 他又飞走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir. He flies off again. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.60,0:56:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他看到了问题的所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he saw what really caused the trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.23,0:56:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他就飞向龙卷风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He flew into the tornado...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.23,0:56:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,从下面往上雅 他就把事情解决了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}went down to the bottom of it, and turned it upside down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.07,0:56:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他使得龙卷风反转了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He made the little end on top and the big end on the bottom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.66,0:56:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我快要疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna go crazy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.24,0:56:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来没看过那样的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen nothing like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.87,0:56:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,把龙卷风阻止了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The big end was on the bottom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.66,0:56:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,上下颠倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little end on the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.33,0:56:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,罗斯先生…它说…很大…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Ross, it was... The big...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.63,0:56:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,超人太坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman's bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.92,0:56:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我说他是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll say he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.55,0:56:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说他很坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, he was bad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.09,0:57:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.68,0:57:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.77,0:57:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,甜心 我来 我来帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, let me help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.27,0:57:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 完美的计划要有傻子愿意执行  - 而我们就是那种傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was a perfect plan. It was foolproof!  - And we were the fools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.77,0:57:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我的错 我尽到本分了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my fault. I did what I was supposed to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.15,0:57:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他破坏的  是个差劲的好人破坏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ruined it. That lousy do-gooder ruined it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.28,0:57:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他或许会破坏到 我的石油计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that he's pulled off this stunt, he'll try and ruin my oil scheme too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.95,0:57:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我必须要除掉他  - 要怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've got to get rid of him.  - How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.79,0:57:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪射他？ 你知道他对子弹的承受度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot him? You know about him and bullets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.46,0:57:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 氪石  - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kryptonite.  - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.75,0:57:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,氪火腿…还是氪豆子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or krypton-ham, or krypton-heimer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.47,0:57:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道要怎么叫它 但是这玩意儿会干掉超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forget what you call it, but it's stuff that can hurt Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.80,0:57:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么会知道的？  - 我还是知道一些事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How would you know about that?  - I know a few things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.81,0:57:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了 从漫画书看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, from the graffiti I saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.60,0:57:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.18,0:57:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,她是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.56,0:57:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,氪石 我记得有一篇采访中 有提到这样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kryptonite. I remember reading about it in an interview with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.94,0:57:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,它是哪里来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does it come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.40,0:57:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,从超人来的星球上有氪石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same planet Superman Krypton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.82,0:57:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里找得到氪石？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Krypton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.49,0:57:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,找不到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.99,0:58:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那星球几年前说炸掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It blew up in space, years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.82,0:58:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们在超人小时候 就送他来地球了  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They sent Superman here from there when he was just a baby. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.49,0:58:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你看我知道一些吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know some things too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.83,0:58:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下…你知道一个星球爆炸 会如何吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. You know what happens when a planet explodes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.50,0:58:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 残骸 东西会飘到太空中  - 怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Debris. Things floating in space.  - So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.29,0:58:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们只要 找到氪石就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So all we have to do is find out where in heaven Krypton used to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.34,0:58:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们只要让格斯在这里 用卫星去找就可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we get good old Gus to contact the Vulcan satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.51,0:58:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,格斯已经在思考这些了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old Gus has been doing some thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.80,0:58:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 这就是我要你办事的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. That's why I keep you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.18,0:58:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是…我是在想我没有得到应有的报酬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I've been thinking that I'm not making enough money for this gig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.85,0:58:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,格斯 我平生最痛恨的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus, if there's anything I hate...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.98,0:58:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就是贪婪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's greed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.36,0:58:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,贪婪？罗斯先生 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greed? Mr. Ross, just a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.69,0:58:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我要说的是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.03,0:58:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会滑雪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't ski!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.06,0:59:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦格斯和华根卫星连上线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once Gus contacts the Vulcan satellite...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.40,0:59:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就可以命令搜寻外太空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he orders it to search through space...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.57,0:59:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就可以找到氮石失落之处了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}around where Krypton went bye-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.83,0:59:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,然后卫星很容易就可以找到氪石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the laser probe locks on to a floating chunk of Kryptonite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.58,0:59:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,由电脑分析成分后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The computer analyzes the components...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.88,0:59:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们此可以在实验室里复制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the boys at the lab duplicate the stuff down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.76,0:59:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,“未知”？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Unknown"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.05,0:59:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,“未知”？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Unknown"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.82,1:00:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,管他的 他又不会去吸它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell, he ain't gonna smoke it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.95,1:00:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,怀特先生无法对此事负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. White can't be responsible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.71,1:00:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.13,1:00:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托啦 两位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Mr. Stokis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.13,1:00:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他要付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll pay for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.34,1:00:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,准备付钱吧 怀特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out your wallet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.88,1:00:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 早安   - 别向我问早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning.  - Don't you "good morning" me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.60,1:00:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,往日关系依旧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old, old relationships suddenly seem very much the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.98,1:00:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,学校中最美的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The prettiest girl in the school...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.48,1:00:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,仍然是学校中最美的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is still the prettiest girl in the school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.36,1:00:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈罗？  - 哈罗 嗨 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello?  - Hello. Oh, hi, Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.82,1:00:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,拉娜 嗨 我正在想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lana! Hi, I was just thinking about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.58,1:00:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.12,1:00:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 瑞奇有些麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I have a problem with Ricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.46,1:00:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事情？瑞奇怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? What happened to Ricky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.96,1:01:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你给他超人的签名 他真的很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Superman's autograph you got him. He got carried away...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.67,1:01:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就告诉其他的孩子 超人会参加他下星期三的生日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and told the kids Superman was coming on his birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.92,1:01:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我知道这样不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, it was wrong...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.34,1:01:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但是… 如果星期三超人没有来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but when Wednesday comes and Superman doesn't show, it's gonna...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.01,1:01:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,拉娜 这种情况 我想我可以去跟超人讲一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Lana, in this case I think I can go ahead and speak for Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.81,1:01:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 他和我相当熟识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, he and I are pretty close, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.10,1:01:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉瑞奇 超人下星期三会到的 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can tell Ricky that Superman will be there on Wednesday, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.90,1:01:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他会尝到最道地的家乡菜 他会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's gonna get the best home-cooked meal he's had...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.69,1:01:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,垂涎三尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.03,1:01:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你告诉超人 我们觉得他很好  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell Superman we think he's wonderful.  - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.20,1:01:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是 克拉克…  - 怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But, Clark...  - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.70,1:01:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你是最好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.54,1:01:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,就算我要告到最高法院 也在所不惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll take it to the Supreme Court if I have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.71,1:01:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这不是我们的错 这是上帝的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it wasn't our fault. It was an act of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.21,1:01:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在教堂里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a church?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.65,1:02:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.94,1:02:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你要的组合物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's that compound you ordered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.07,1:02:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法想像这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't imagine what you want with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.15,1:02:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你可以拿去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.83,1:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我在怕什么鬼？ 我是地球人耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell am I afraid for? I'm from Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.46,1:02:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,拉娜 我真的不知道会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lana, I really wasn't expecting all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.84,1:02:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他们真的想做一些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess they did get a little carried away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.23,1:02:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 我们都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman, we all know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.11,1:02:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你并不期望被表扬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you're not looking for honors and awards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.69,1:02:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但是当我们听到你要来此 找你的好友瑞奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when we heard that you were coming to see your pal Ricky...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.49,1:02:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想这是 我们向你说谢谢的好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we realized that this was our chance to say thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.49,1:02:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,首先是扑灭化学厂的大火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, for putting out the Lake Comooga fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.37,1:03:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你救了瑞奇一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And not least, for saving little Ricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.12,1:03:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你已经 在我们的心中占有一席之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So since you already have the key to our hearts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.96,1:03:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,超人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.30,1:03:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,容许我在此向你献上市钥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may I present you with the key to the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.59,1:03:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.01,1:03:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.66,1:03:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.33,1:03:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,现在听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now listen up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.16,1:03:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just came in directly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.17,1:03:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,从五角大厦过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the Pentagon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.58,1:03:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你们最好相信我来此的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you better believe there's a damn good reason that I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.67,1:03:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,因为上帝给了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because God has given us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.18,1:03:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上最好的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of the greatest gifts in the world:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.05,1:03:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,化学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chemicals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.81,1:04:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些人 在星期天去做礼拜 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you people, you like to go sit in church on Sunday, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.81,1:04:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你们喜欢坐着看超级杯比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like to sit and watch the Super Bowl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.44,1:04:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.69,1:04:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,而你们坐在什么上面？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit on what?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.15,1:04:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是坐在做好的塑胶椅上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sit on molded, plastic seats!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.16,1:04:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这样此可以让你们好好地坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Molded to your well-fed behinds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.20,1:04:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我不需要告诉你们 美国在这方面的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I don't have to tell you that America leads the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.71,1:04:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,领先程度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in high-grade plastics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.54,1:04:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法承受 化学塑胶的差距\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot afford a chemical-plastics gap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.13,1:04:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 听我说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.09,1:04:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.89,1:04:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的美国总统坐下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our president of the United States sitting down...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.10,1:04:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,写一篇和平条约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to write a peace treaty...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.23,1:04:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,让他的原子笔爆开后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and have his ballpoint pen bust open...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.36,1:04:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,墨水弄脏他那 好看又干净的裤子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the ink run out all over his nice, clean pants...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.73,1:04:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在全世界的领袖面前出挨吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in front of the world leaders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.74,1:04:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.11,1:04:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we all know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.12,1:05:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,上星期全世界半数的国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that last week, half of this great nation of ours...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.66,1:05:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,都遭受灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}almost bit the bullet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.91,1:05:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是他 后果不堪设想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if it wasn't for this man here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.54,1:05:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能说感谢上苍 赐予我们超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all I can say is, thank the Lord for Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.89,1:05:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 你解救了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman, you saved our bacon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.22,1:05:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而我要表达我的感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'd like to show our gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.64,1:05:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,小小意思 不成敬意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a small token of our appreciation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.23,1:05:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你让我们避免了 一场化学大灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to show to you for saving us from a chemical-plant disaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.12,1:05:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much, general.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.29,1:05:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这真好 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is very nice. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.88,1:06:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.31,1:06:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,“未知”我要如何知道 什么是“未知”？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unknown. How am I supposed to know what "unknown" means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.23,1:06:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,“未知”就是没有人会知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means unknown. It means nobody knows what it means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.44,1:06:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈罗 老板？  - 格斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello, boss?  - Gus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.15,1:06:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是格斯高曼  - 我知道 情况如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gus Gorman here.  - I know that. How did it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.70,1:06:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是 你知道他们在找 烹调上的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how they're always trying to find the secret recipe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.49,1:06:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有多难吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in that chicken in the bucket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.50,1:06:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,而似乎没有人知道配方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And nobody seems to know the ingredient...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.71,1:06:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有“未知”的成分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because it's unknown, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.50,1:06:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,氪石也有一个不知道的成分 还有…超人没有死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the Kryptonite there was an unknown element and Superman didn't die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.71,1:06:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.51,1:06:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你去杀超人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ask you to kill Superman...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.34,1:06:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而你却告诉我 你无法做到这种简单的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're telling me you couldn't even do that one simple thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.85,1:06:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,哈罗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.87,1:07:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他好久没有睡午觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hasn't had an afternoon nap for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.66,1:07:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我想今天是他最重要的日子 而我不知要如何感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the biggest day of his life. I don't know how to thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.50,1:07:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那顿丰富的午餐已经表达谢意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did with that wonderful lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.33,1:07:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我是喜欢煮饭烧菜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, I do like to cook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.55,1:07:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你喝咖啡吧？  - 好 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You'll take some coffee?  - Yes, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.76,1:07:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 低咖啡因的  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Decaffeinated, of course.  - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.89,1:07:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哈罗？是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.06,1:07:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.77,1:07:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.86,1:07:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是 他在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.23,1:07:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我会告诉他 好的 谢谢 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell him. Okay, thanks. Bye-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.40,1:07:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 我的朋友贝蒂说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman, that was my friend Betty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.57,1:07:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,河流的桥上发生意外 一部卡车出了车祸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an accident on the bridge. A trailer crashed through the rail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.24,1:07:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,车子悬在桥上 司机还在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hanging off the bridge and the driver's in the cab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.87,1:07:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我不是要赶你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I hate to make you rush off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.91,1:07:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一点都不赶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's no rush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.92,1:07:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是在桥上…  - 没关系 我会赶到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But the bridge...  - It's okay. I always get there on time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.88,1:08:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 我们休息一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's relax a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.39,1:08:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,要找到像你这么漂亮的 单身女孩很不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's unusual finding a good-looking girl like you alone like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.53,1:08:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 你确定桥那边没问题吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, are you sure you shouldn't do something about the bridge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.12,1:08:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么桥？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What bridge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.63,1:08:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.97,1:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.65,1:08:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,把他弄出来 快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him out of there. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.48,1:09:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,快点弄出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him out! Get him out quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.32,1:09:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,弄出来 要掉下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Get him away. That thing's gonna go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.87,1:09:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,大家还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody okay? Joe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.67,1:09:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我能帮上什么忙吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I do to help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.13,1:09:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,现在没什么好帮的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not much of anything now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.84,1:09:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能早点来 就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only you'd got here a minute sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.75,1:10:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,在一次特别的会议中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"At a special session of the General Assembly..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.46,1:10:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有178个国家投票谴责超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}178 countries voted to censure Superman...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.88,1:10:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,只有哥伦比亚一个弃权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"...with only Colombia abstaining".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.51,1:10:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能告诉你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can tell you one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.22,1:10:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他在小镇并没有如此坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't so mean and nasty the other day in Smallville.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.26,1:10:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上他真的很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, he was so full of niceness...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.85,1:11:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢用这样的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hated laying that big chunk of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.94,1:11:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,氪石…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kryptonite. Don't you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.11,1:11:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你没看出实验室的成果吗？ 并没有完全失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That stuff we ran off in the lab wasn't a complete failure after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.61,1:11:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就在格斯给他这份礼物后 他就变得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right after Gus gave it to him, he started to turn into...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.70,1:11:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,卑鄙 邪恶 心怀不轨 自私\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an ornery, evil, malicious, selfish...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.99,1:11:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一个平常人   - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A normal person.  - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.49,1:11:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在超人 就不会再做好事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now that Superman is out of the nice-guy business...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.21,1:11:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们此可以进行石油计划了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can get to work on that oil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.65,1:11:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是极为重要的时刻 最后一位跑者…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, the supreme moment, as the last runner...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.98,1:11:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,以无比荣誉的心态 手持圣火…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the one given the great honor of lighting the ceremonial flame...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.11,1:11:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,跑完了为时七天的马拉松…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}runs the last leg of a marathon that began seven days ago...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.45,1:12:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很多选手…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as this torch has been passed from athlete to athlete...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.37,1:12:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,经过全国…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for 970 miles...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.29,1:12:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,970英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}across the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.29,1:12:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么能说单纯分类没有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can he say that pure categories have no objective meaning...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.80,1:12:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,重要的逻辑？ 那综合性的连贯呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in transcendental logic? What about synthetic unity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.51,1:13:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 甜心 我妨碍到你了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, honey! Am I in your way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.43,1:13:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在旁边看着或许你会学到什么  - 嗨 罗蕾莱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stick around, you may learn something.  - Hi, Lorelei.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.56,1:13:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上所有的油轮 都由电脑控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the oil tankers in the world are totally controlled by computers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.40,1:13:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑告诉他们要去哪里 要运多少油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They tell them where to go, how much oil to pick up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.48,1:13:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,要去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and where to deliver it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.36,1:13:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在船上没船长吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't they have captains on these ships?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.40,1:13:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,有 但是不需要他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but they don't need them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.03,1:13:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来真有点伤感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a throwback to some sentimental, seafaring baloney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.49,1:13:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你要下令这些油轮 朝一个在大西洋中央…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will command the tankers to sail toward a 50-mile area...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.37,1:13:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,五十英里的区域去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the middle of the Atlantic Ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.41,1:13:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,然后要做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.25,1:13:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也不做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And do nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.67,1:13:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就待在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just sit there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.09,1:13:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那人们要如何得到石油？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are all the people gonna get their oil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.13,1:13:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你反应真快 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You catch on fast, old buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.26,1:13:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,美国每一个油井都是由…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every oil pump in America is run by...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.64,1:13:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 由电脑控制 我知道  - 你不要打断我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Computers. I know.  - Will you stop interrupting?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.60,1:13:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.10,1:13:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你要下令 所有的油井停止供油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will command the pumps to stop pumping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.07,1:13:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我要你设计一个 特别的程式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I want you to program one special command...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.20,1:14:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在所有的系统中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into all these systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.45,1:14:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,一个无法更改的程式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them these orders are irreversible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.45,1:14:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人能够再把它改回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it would be impossible for anybody to switch them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.41,1:14:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你办得到吗 老兄？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you do this for me, old buddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.83,1:14:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,老友？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old pal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.05,1:14:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直要用你的方法去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you get your way all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.64,1:14:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's not right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.85,1:14:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我要知道我有什么好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna know when I get a taste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.44,1:14:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你已经尝到 自由的滋味 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you've already had a taste of freedom, haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.90,1:14:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,还是你想要坐牢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or would you prefer jail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.66,1:14:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经无法让我去坐牢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't run that jail number on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.83,1:14:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我知道我在外面的价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I know I mean more to you out here doing things for you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.62,1:14:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,比在牢里面无所事事要高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than sitting in jail doing nothing for nobody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.08,1:14:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.34,1:14:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你要什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.51,1:15:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？垃圾？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? A wastebasket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.18,1:15:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这是计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. These are plans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.18,1:15:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是蓝图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blueprints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.23,1:15:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么？  - 一部电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For what?  - A computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.48,1:15:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们已经有电脑了  - 不 不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We've already got computers.  - No, not like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.48,1:15:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,目前世界上 没有一个电脑能像这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's not a computer like this in the whole world anyplace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.57,1:15:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,目前不存在的 你要知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't exist. You see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.74,1:15:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须去建造新的电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have to build it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.57,1:15:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那它会做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will it do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.99,1:15:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我所说的任何事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything I tell it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.37,1:15:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那对我有何好处？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will it do for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.70,1:15:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对你而言？任何你告诉我的事 我都可以帮你做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you? It will do anything you tell me to tell it to do for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.38,1:15:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.89,1:15:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,首先如果任何人想要攻击它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First of all, if anyone attacks this machine or anything...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.39,1:15:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑会自动反击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the computer counterattacks it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.00,1:15:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,它会自动找到他们的弱点 解决对方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it finds their weaknesses and wipes them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.98,1:15:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好 老友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, old buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.27,1:15:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮我处理石油 我就建一部电脑给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You deal with my oil and I'll build you your machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.74,1:16:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我会做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.57,1:16:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,只是我无法复原的程式 没有太大的把握\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm not so sure about this irreversible business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.26,1:16:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他们全部停工了 怎么搞的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They all kind of went... What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.35,1:16:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样了 最后一艘油轮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. The last tanker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.52,1:16:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们全都是 全都是我的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all mine now. All mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.98,1:16:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,耶…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yay...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.69,1:16:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.11,1:16:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,在上面那一个是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that in the upper-middle quadrant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.61,1:16:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是油轮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a tanker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.24,1:16:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,它走错路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's going the wrong way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.96,1:17:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,船长？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skipper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.30,1:17:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,又来了 “马上到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is again. "Proceed immediately to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.17,1:17:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,北纬30度 西经45度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}latitude 30 north, longitude 45 west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.97,1:17:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,等待进一步的指示”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There await further orders."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.81,1:17:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那是大西洋的中央\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, that's the middle of the Atlantic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.14,1:17:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不要把我的船开到那里 等待什么指示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not taking my ship there just to await further orders...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.27,1:17:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,才不管上面说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no matter what that says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.02,1:17:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该去大都会 我们就去大都会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're supposed to go to Metropolis, and we're going to Metropolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.82,1:17:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.50,1:17:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where she is. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.00,1:17:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 到上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get it up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.50,1:17:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.42,1:17:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐 你听到我了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss, can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.84,1:17:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我们是到这里来帮你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, we are here to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.72,1:17:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不要跳 我重复 不要跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't jump. I repeat, do not jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.81,1:17:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你永远不会来此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought you'd never get here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.06,1:17:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你不会指望我来救你 因为我再也不这么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't expect me to save you. I don't do that anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.02,1:18:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.27,1:18:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要被救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm long past saving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.90,1:18:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.03,1:18:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别让我耽误你的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't let me keep you from anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.53,1:18:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我并没有其他的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not in a rush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.96,1:18:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你在想些什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you have in mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.29,1:18:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,很多事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lots of things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.05,1:18:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.84,1:18:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.42,1:18:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你可以帮我一个小忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'll just do me one little favor first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.55,1:18:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,要做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.39,1:18:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.68,1:18:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有一艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, there's this little boat...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.10,1:18:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没有去该去的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's not going where it's supposed to go and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.43,1:19:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,停止所有引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop all engines!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.10,1:19:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,停止所有引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop all engines!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.16,1:20:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.22,1:20:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要先来点前奏？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a little après-ski?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.60,1:20:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,香槟？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Champagne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.80,1:21:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不要插队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your turn like everybody else!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.84,1:21:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.64,1:21:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他要过来了 摇上窗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's coming over here, Martha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.23,1:21:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你不可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you do that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.23,1:21:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.53,1:21:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,用包包打他啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit him with your handbag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.08,1:21:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 请救我 有人正在打我先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me! Please, help me. Somebody's beating up my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.58,1:21:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要去报警  - 杰克 你跟她去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've gotta call the police.  - Jack, go with her, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.25,1:21:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是今天第三次了 晚上会更糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The third one today, and at night it's worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.96,1:21:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,后面一定有人搞鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's behind this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.96,1:21:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你别告诉我没有石油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't tell me there's no oil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.88,1:21:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你别告诉我 没有人因此发财\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't say someone's not getting rich off this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.47,1:22:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,永远都会有人发财\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's always getting rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.51,1:22:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而你知道是谁受苦吗？小市民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who suffers? The small guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.72,1:22:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,东部地区一片混乱 你们快点把东西弄进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The East Coast gets the brunt of the spill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.78,1:22:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 大伙 慢一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey guy slower down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.64,1:22:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我今晚不能跟你出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I cannot go out with you tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.65,1:22:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天晚上也很忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm busy tomorrow night too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.36,1:22:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？要做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? Doing what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.57,1:22:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我会想到一些 听着…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll think of something. Look...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.61,1:23:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要走了 瑞奇需要我  - 拉娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...I gotta go. Ricky needs me.  - Lana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.95,1:23:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱德 我告诉过你 不要再打给我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brad, please stop calling me. I've told you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.24,1:23:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you listen to me, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.49,1:23:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好要开始感谢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better start appreciating old Brad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.91,1:23:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,否则你在小镇还能怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else you got in Smallville?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.38,1:23:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我在小镇能怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else have I got in Smallville?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.47,1:23:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我有答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I got the right answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.14,1:23:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.60,1:23:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,小镇机场 明天有飞机去大都会吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smallville Airport, what flights do you have to Metropolis tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.95,1:23:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要我放哪里？  - 放在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where do I put this?  - Over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.20,1:23:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个你要我放哪里？  - 放在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where do you want this?  - Put it up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.54,1:23:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吗？我才不要进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding? I'm not going in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.40,1:24:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.24,1:24:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不要管他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just leave him alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.18,1:24:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我过不去了 小姐 那里发生了事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get through. Something's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.52,1:24:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看 超人喝醉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look! Superman's drunk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.52,1:24:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要看看这里发生了什么事  - 瑞奇…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wanna see what's happening here.  - Ricky. Ricky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.19,1:25:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瑞奇  - 对 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ricky.  - Yeah, that's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.65,1:25:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 真可耻 真是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you.  - It's a disgrace, that's what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.11,1:25:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你 没有人会再相信这个败类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you, nobody's ever gonna trust that creep again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.12,1:25:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's washed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.08,1:25:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在看什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking at? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.17,1:25:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 超人？是我 瑞奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Superman? It's me, Ricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.59,1:25:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,小镇的瑞奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ricky from Smallville.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.46,1:25:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 告诉他们 你不会伤害任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman tell them you won't hurt anybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.42,1:25:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.76,1:25:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不 或许他只是生病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Maybe he's just sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.64,1:25:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 请好起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman, please get better!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.68,1:25:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有听到你说的 瑞奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not listening to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.31,1:25:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他会听到 他听得到的 他有顺风耳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, he is. He can hear me. He's got super-hearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.31,1:25:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 你只是陷入低潮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman, you're just in a slump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.10,1:25:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你会好起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be great again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.06,1:25:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你办得到的 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do it, Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.77,1:25:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 你听得到我 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman, you can hear me, can't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.94,1:25:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 你只是陷入低潮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman, you're just in a slump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.66,1:25:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你会好起来的 你办得到的 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be great again. You can do it, Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.45,1:25:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 你听得到我 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman, you can hear me, can't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.68,1:26:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone nuts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.60,1:26:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.61,1:27:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can give as good as I get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.69,1:27:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？好啊 来啊 快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? All right, come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.86,1:27:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.10,1:28:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 肯特？ 太热了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter, Kent? Too warm for you, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.85,1:28:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 懦夫 来抓我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, chicken! Come and get me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.81,1:28:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经把我给惹毛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been on my nerves a long time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.00,1:28:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直想要飞起来 肯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always wanted to fly, Kent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.30,1:28:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,现在机会来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now's your chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.64,1:33:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,船长…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skipper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.78,1:34:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, would you look at that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.58,1:34:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,罗蕾莱小姐 目前不在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Lorelei Ambrosia isn't at home right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.41,1:35:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但是如果你有重要事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you'd care to leave a message...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.83,1:35:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,何不当面跟她说呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why not deliver it to her in person?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.38,1:35:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你终于展现出原来的你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you've finally shown your true colors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.96,1:35:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想找我们 这里是你找到我们的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you're looking for us, here's where you'll find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.43,1:35:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,请快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do drop in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.73,1:35:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这真好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, this is fun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.81,1:35:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好玩？好玩的事情才开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fun? The fun's just starting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.44,1:35:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,等到超人找到我们 你们此会知道什么叫做好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait till Superman finds us, then you'll see some fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.48,1:35:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 你要搞超人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, you gonna mess with Superman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.15,1:35:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 我要在他进入陷阱前准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. I want to be ready for him when he falls into our trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.65,1:35:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,陷阱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.45,1:35:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是不懂你为何不能 像我们一样搭热汽球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't see why you can't balloon down like the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.50,1:35:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.41,1:35:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.75,1:35:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不相信人可以飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't believe a man can fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.44,1:36:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点 马儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out, horsy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.16,1:36:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't, don't, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.45,1:36:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不要想要飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't try to fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.12,1:36:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't try to fly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.80,1:36:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要档住我的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you get out of my way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.07,1:36:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快 快点  - 我很快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hurry! Hurry up!  - I am hurrying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.00,1:37:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我什么也看不到  - 把灯打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't see anything.  - Turn on the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.46,1:37:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 灯的开关在哪里？  - 通常灯的开关在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the light switch?  - Where do you usually find it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.42,1:37:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我检查一下入口处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I guess I'll check the doorway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.92,1:37:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 这里真黑 这样好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, it's pitch-black in here. Oh, that's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.26,1:37:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒的设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, what a jukebox!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.18,1:37:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你们嘛 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, didn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.31,1:37:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 这就是超极限电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. The ultimate computer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.78,1:37:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,它会所有普通电脑会做的事情 还有其他电脑不会做的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It does everything a computer can do and 1000 things none of them can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.74,1:37:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 让我们来试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's give it a dry run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.37,1:37:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 我们要等格斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. We've gotta wait for Gus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.49,1:37:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,谁需要格斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who needs Gus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.95,1:37:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只有他会控制电脑  - 简单得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's the only one who can operate it.  - Like fish he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.54,1:37:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我比博士都还了解 如何使用电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know enough about computers to put a Ph.D. to shame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.96,1:37:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 老哥 你以为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come now, brother dear, you didn't think...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.67,1:37:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的会让那个小黑人玩吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna let that little man run the show, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.76,1:37:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,工人做好了 怎么不收拾好呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't peons tidy up when they're done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.01,1:38:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 老哥 好戏登场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Bubba, it's showtime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.22,1:38:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,用那些按钮去启动阿尔法回路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engage those buttons to activate the alpha circuit...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.10,1:38:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,锁住系数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lock the modular grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.69,1:38:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你 启动29到W7处的线路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You! Activate circuits 29 through W-7...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.77,1:38:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,然后开启全部能量 展开防御系统功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and start full-power coordinates on exterior defensive systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.07,1:38:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,换句话说 按红色按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In other words, push this red button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.78,1:38:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.72,1:38:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.93,1:38:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 给他点事做做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Let's give him something to worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.02,1:38:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们来看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, let's see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.93,1:38:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,导弹系统启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracking systems locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.80,1:39:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,让游戏开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the games begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.80,1:39:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,别太兴奋 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tense up now, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.96,1:39:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 老哥 你在浪费火箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Bubba, you're wasting your rockets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.26,1:40:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.43,1:40:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把他干掉 罗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him have it, Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.19,1:40:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,老哥 继续发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bubba, keep firing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.19,1:40:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,让他没时间顾到别的 我要准备飞弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep him occupied while I get the MX ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.10,1:40:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.40,1:41:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你继续发射火箭 等他发现飞弹就来不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep your rockets coming. He won't notice the missile till too late!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.24,1:41:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不过尔尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So much for your catlike reflexes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.88,1:41:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.80,1:41:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哈 哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha, ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.43,1:41:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托…不要…坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more. Look, you sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.60,1:41:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对…坐下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit, sit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.11,1:41:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.94,1:41:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哈罗 不要乱动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Forget you, jackass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.36,1:41:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他就这样完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.87,1:41:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,老妹 你要控制全世界的武器系统吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sis, how would you like to control all the world's weapons systems?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.83,1:41:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.25,1:41:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.79,1:42:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你要对我的宝贝做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what are you doing with my baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.42,1:42:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,格斯 老搭档 上来一起玩吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus, old buddy, genius. Come up and join the fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.48,1:42:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他又过来了 启动内部防御\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still coming. Arm the inner defenses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.48,1:42:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 维斯伯 游戏结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, the game's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.65,1:42:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.24,1:42:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认识你 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know you, lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.45,1:42:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但是在那个晚上…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the other night...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.29,1:42:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 但是那不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, but that wasn't me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.66,1:42:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That guy's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.79,1:42:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,而你是下一位 维斯伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're next, Webster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.38,1:42:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别低估 电脑的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never underestimate the power of computers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.09,1:42:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.63,1:42:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,维斯伯 你就像其他人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's typical of people like you, Webster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.47,1:42:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们四个所做的 只是想满足自己的需求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead of helping others, the four of you just wanna help yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.01,1:42:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你们四个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.52,1:43:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你说我们四个？等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean, us? Four? Wait...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.85,1:43:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.69,1:43:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他只有一个名字 他希望别人称他“超人”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's only his last name. He likes to be called "Superman."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.15,1:43:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这样 我跟他们不同国 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I'm not with them, Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.36,1:43:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你是骗不了我的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could've fooled me, mister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.12,1:43:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那个很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.08,1:43:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们看看没有空气 他能撑多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see how long he can carry on without any air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.74,1:43:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他又来了  他要来抓我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still coming! He's going to get me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.86,1:43:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,才不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bet on it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.67,1:44:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你在伤害他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hurting him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.13,1:44:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是氪石   - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's Kryptonite!  - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.38,1:44:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这一次我们做对了  - 你是个天才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This time we got it right!  - You're a genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.47,1:44:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你所发明的机器 可以找到任何人的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've invented a machine that can find anybody's weak spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.56,1:44:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜了 老弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, old buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.27,1:44:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你将留名青史 因为你干掉了超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll go down in history as the man who killed Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.73,1:44:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm... No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.65,1:44:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.11,1:44:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.23,1:44:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等一下…你以为你要去哪里？  - 别管他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where do you think you're going?  - Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.70,1:44:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 增加能量  - 你不觉得他的能量够了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Turn the power up.  - Hasn't he had enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.45,1:44:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,再增加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.91,1:44:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,能量 要更多能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power! More power!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.48,1:45:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,75 流量 7点75\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seventy-five. Current 7.75.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.23,1:45:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有七级的电流 但是不是在这里 所以就…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a current level of 7 that is not supposed to be on bar...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.20,1:45:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, here it is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.43,1:45:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.35,1:45:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 没有电了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. The power's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.65,1:45:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是格斯关掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus must have pulled the plug out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.02,1:45:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了 真的成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.69,1:45:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我成功了…我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It worked! I got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.03,1:46:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.04,1:46:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把螺丝给我  - 这个螺丝？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give me that screw.  - This screw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.00,1:46:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个螺丝  - 绝不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That screw.  - Never!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.54,1:46:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 等等 我看不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wait. I can't see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.61,1:46:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.57,1:46:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.58,1:46:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不… 阻止它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Make it stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.37,1:46:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我没办法 它失去控制了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't! It's out of control!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.04,1:46:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但是怎么会呢？ 哪里来的能量？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how? Where's it getting the power from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.75,1:46:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,它自己弄的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's feeding itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.17,1:46:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,它要活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wants to live!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.32,1:47:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这里 我们去动物园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's this thing here. We'll go to the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.70,1:47:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们明天去 然后再去别的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do that tomorrow, and then we'll go on to the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.08,1:47:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事？我怕  - 没关系 瑞奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's happening?  - It's okay, Ricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.87,1:47:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,把灯打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the lights on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.98,1:47:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 你会杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it! You're killing him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.82,1:47:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.66,1:48:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,放我下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Put me down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.35,1:48:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,别把我们留在这里 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave us alone in here! Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.77,1:48:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.06,1:48:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,能源轴是能源出处 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The coaxial energy shaft is engaging the grid source factor. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.86,1:48:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们完了 我要先溜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're through, frogface. I'm splitting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.86,1:48:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wait a minute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.99,1:48:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,女孩 快离开那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girls. Girls, come out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.30,1:49:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,救我 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.22,1:49:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,老妹？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.18,1:49:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.07,1:49:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.96,1:49:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,罗蕾莱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorelei!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.75,1:49:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,老妹 我是你哥 不要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sis, it's your Bubba!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.96,1:50:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me. Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.84,1:50:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.22,1:50:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.47,1:50:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,甜心 我卡在这里 救命  那我呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, I'm stuck here! Help! What about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.48,1:50:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.86,1:52:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,老哥？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bubba?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.41,1:53:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.17,1:53:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,普通还是高级的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regular or premium?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.09,1:53:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,管他的 她好久没有加油了 给她最好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She hasn't had a drink in so long, give her a tankful of the good stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.09,1:54:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得如何 格斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.30,1:54:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要跟我说话 我的麻烦已经够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't talk to me. I'm having enough trouble hanging on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.60,1:54:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们可以慢一点 你非常安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we'll go slow. You're perfectly safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.98,1:54:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会跟你争辩这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna argue with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.56,1:54:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,能够破解我的机器 就能做到任何事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, any man who can trick my machine can do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.86,1:54:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你是如何破解防御的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you beat my defenses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.78,1:54:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那个机器是很厉害 但它不知道会有麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those defenses are good as long as it didn't know it's in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.40,1:54:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这一次它不知道危险的地方 我只是把特殊化学物拿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time it didn't see the danger. I went in with plain old acid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.12,1:54:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,当那种酸到达一定温度时 它就会毁掉所有的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It didn't know that when acid gets hot, it'll eat through anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.29,1:54:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心树  - 喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch the trees.  - Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.46,1:54:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我想这次它死于酸性消化不良\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess it died of acid indigestion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.79,1:54:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那我的老板 和两位小姐会如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what's gonna happen to Ross and the ladies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.55,1:54:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要去和警察谈谈了 那不是你的问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna have to see the police. It's not your problem anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.63,1:54:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到大都会了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we in Metropolis yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.39,1:54:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,还没 我们要在那里停一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. We're just gonna make a little stop right over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.68,1:54:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.15,1:54:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们降落了 格斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on the ground, Gus. Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.86,1:54:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 超人？  - 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay, Supe?  - I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.07,1:54:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.57,1:55:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可以给我一些这个吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you guys spare one of these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.24,1:55:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 当然可以 超人  - 这是超人 是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sure, Superman.  - Lt is Superman, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.16,1:55:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding? Ls that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.37,1:55:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没看到我们在天上飞吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't you see us fly out of the sky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.29,1:55:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我和超人会飞耶 这位是超人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the only two men who can fly. "Is it Superman?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.09,1:55:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.43,1:55:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好 格斯 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Gus, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.68,1:55:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我就怕你这样说 我想我还是坐公车好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was afraid you'd say that. I thought I'd take the bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.26,1:55:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,随便你啦 你们老板有电脑吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, suit yourself. Does your boss have a computer here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.93,1:55:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是 他有一台小电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he got a little bitty one about that big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.02,1:55:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉他 格斯会做很多电脑相关事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell him he can do a lot worse than to give Gus Gorman here a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.94,1:55:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, thank you, Supe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.86,1:55:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,保重了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.78,1:55:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们再会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.37,1:55:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.50,1:55:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,保重 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.59,1:56:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有人强力谁荐你 你想要这份工作吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you got good references, so if you want that job...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.85,1:56:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不要了 这不适合我 我想我要去搭公车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, this is not for me. I think I'll take that bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.81,1:56:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,能告诉我车站在哪里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you tell me where the bus station is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.93,1:56:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 到那里要走9或10英里路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, about nine, 10 miles over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.73,1:56:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,9或10英里路 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine or 10 miles. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.36,1:56:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的跟他一起飞吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. You really flew with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.61,1:56:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,超人？ 你们以前见过超人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman? Have you ever seen Superman before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.66,1:56:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.99,1:56:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道我和他的关系？ 我和超人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you don't know about me and him? Me and Superman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.67,1:56:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是 我们都是一起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we go way back together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.17,1:56:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直 通常 有时候是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We always, usually, sometimes, we...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.30,1:56:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,9或10英里路吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine or 10 miles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.59,1:56:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我用走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'll walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.89,1:56:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我用走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'll walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.89,1:56:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.15,1:56:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.69,1:57:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真是惊讶 请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a nice surprise! Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.86,1:57:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 肯特先生   - 嗨 瑞奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gosh. Hi, Mr. Kent.  - Hi, Ricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.61,1:57:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 猜猜看今晚谁要来吃饭？  - 是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guess who Mom's having dinner with.  - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.32,1:57:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.24,1:57:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 这就是我要来告诉你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's what I came to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.66,1:57:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,超人要告诉你 他真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman said to tell you he's sorry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.74,1:57:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他有些事情 他今晚无法与你吃饭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he's run into a problem and he won't be able to have dinner with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.58,1:57:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我猜他错过了很多次的晚餐  - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I guess he misses a lot of dinners.  - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.04,1:57:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你介意我和你吃吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you mind settling for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.13,1:57:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.26,1:57:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去拿东西  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll get my things.  - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.51,1:57:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,拉娜 我那天和超人聊天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Lana, I was talking to Superman the other day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.22,1:57:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 他和我 我们聊了很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, he and I, we talk a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.48,1:57:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他很难过 你当了你的钻石戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he felt badly about you having to pawn your diamond ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.90,1:57:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他发现这个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he found...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.61,1:57:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他在地上发现这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He found this one just lying around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.11,1:57:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他要你收下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted you to have this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.42,1:57:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,超人送的戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, a ring from Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.54,1:58:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没关系 我来处理  - 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's okay. I got it.  - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.50,1:58:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.76,1:58:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克拉克  - 没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, Clark.  - It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.30,1:58:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大小刚好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It fits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.09,1:58:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真好看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks really pretty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.60,1:58:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.85,1:58:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 布莱德  - 布莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brad.  - Brad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.39,1:58:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.27,1:58:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,肯特 我恨你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kent, I hate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.11,1:58:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都恨你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always hated you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.57,1:58:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道为何吗？  - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know why?  - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.49,1:58:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为你人很好  - 也不是真的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Because you're nice.  - Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.32,1:58:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好人要完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And nice guys finish last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.58,1:58:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,露易丝 我必须要交给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois, I've got to hand it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.42,1:58:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谁能够将三星期的假期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who else could turn a vacation into a story...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.01,1:58:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,变成揭发 加勒比海腐败内慕的报导呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that'll blow the lid off of corruption in the Caribbean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.18,1:58:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,当计程车司机绑架我时 我就知道不对劲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew I was on to something when that taxi driver kidnapped me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.68,1:58:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,露易丝 你真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois, you're terrific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.89,1:58:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须这样 我似乎遇到竞争对手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to be. Seems I've got some new competition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.48,1:58:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,唔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.19,1:59:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你所写的同学聚会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The story that you wrote on the class reunion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.94,1:59:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得太好了  - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought it was terrific.  - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.90,1:59:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,非常吸引人 尤其是家乡女孩的那部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And fascinating. I liked the part about the little girl back home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.69,1:59:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我带你去吃午饭 你把详情告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take you to lunch and you tell me about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.82,1:59:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想要 露易丝 但是今天 我要和怀特先生的新秘书吃饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd love to, but I'm having lunch with Mr. White's new secretary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.28,1:59:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 拉娜  - 嗨 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Lana.  - Hi, Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.49,1:59:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,露易丝 这位是拉娜… 小镇献给大都会的最新礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lana. Lois, say hello to Lana Lang, Smallville's newest gift to Metropolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.00,1:59:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 莲恩小姐 我很喜欢你的作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad to meet you. I like your writing a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.83,1:59:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.88,1:59:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢你的钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like your sparkler a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.42,1:59:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是 当克拉克给我的时候 我也无法相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me too. I couldn't believe it when Clark gave it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.84,1:59:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克拉克给你的？  - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clark gave it to you?  - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.68,1:59:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怀特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. White.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.27,1:59:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怀特先生 看看我弄了什么给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. White, look what I've got for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.60,1:59:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我爱死这部机器了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People, I am in love with this machine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.69,1:59:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 如果你们不介意… 但是我午餐前还有事情要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. White, excuse me, but I have a couple of errands to run before lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.53,1:59:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 请吧 怀特先生  - 手把在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go ahead, Mr. White.  - Where's the handle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.45,1:59:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没有手把 你只要按按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no handle. You just push the button.{\r}
